{
  "id": "minimax-h3-10eros-beta5-turbo-pack",
  "name": "Community — MiniMax H3 (10Eros Max beta5, Turbo)",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "TenStrip",
  "nsfw": true,
  "description": "MiniMax H3 on TenStrip's 10Eros Max beta5 TURBO-hybrid: the same beta5 hybrid checkpoint with the turbo delta baked into the weights, so it runs at 8 steps with no Turbo LoRA to download or hold in memory (the author's figure: 4.2 GB saved against loading the LoRAs). One 21 GB INT8 file carries first-frame and reference-to-video character, so text-, image- and reference-to-video all run on it. Two-seed bake-off on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti at 480p, 5 s: about 105 s per clip, the same wall as the larryvrh Turbo LoRA at 6 steps, and on a face-visible image-to-video test the 8-step turbo was sharper than the 20-step plain beta5 at half the time, identity and dialogue held. Sampler is res_multistep / simple, the author's pick for motion quality; LCM was softer on faces in our tests. This is a separate download from the plain beta5 pack (different file); pick one unless you want both. Grafted character from LTX 2.3, Wan 2.2 and Krea 2 means their community licences apply alongside the MiniMax H3 licence.",
  "tags": [
    "Local",
    "Video",
    "T2V",
    "MiniMax H3",
    "Finetune",
    "10Eros"
  ],
  "presets": [
